*> COBOL 2014 ARITHMETIC clause selecting standard decimal arithmetic.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STDDEC.
OPTIONS.
    ARITHMETIC IS STANDARD-DECIMAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 R PIC 9V9(6).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE R = 2 / 3
    DISPLAY "2 / 3 under standard-decimal=" R
    STOP RUN.
